> I am not entirely sure why the tests are only failing on 3 of the 4 environments, but since Windows is the only one passing I would guess that Windows is running all of the tests on the UI thread, while the other platforms do not.
> 
> The tests specifically are failing right after trying to create the window in `PlatformCreate()` because `Sdl.Window.Create(...)` fails. It did not fail prior to adding `Sdl.Window.State.OpenGL` to it, so I suspect that this has to run on the UI thread.
