> To reiterate from an earlier comment, putting `OpenGL` into the init flags for the `PlatformCreate()` SDL window would require the `NoSuitableGraphicsDeviceException` to be thrown there and would result in all of the Linux and MacOS tests to fail. I found no remediation for those tests without removing the exception being thrown from there, but without the exception it would not bubble up the correct error messages to the developer/end user (causing the confusion that this PR was meant to solve).
